  "description": {
    "ja": {
      "source": "Wikipedia 日本語版「リュウキュウバショウ」",
      "source_url": "https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E3%83%AA%E3%83%A5%E3%82%A6%E3%82%AD%E3%83%A5%E3%82%A6%E3%83%90%E3%82%B7%E3%83%A7%E3%82%A6",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-09",
      "revision": 109287081,
      "text": "リュウキュウバショウ は、南アジア東部、東南アジア北部、および中国南部原産のバショウ科バショウ属の植物。マレーヤマバショウ と共に、現代の栽培品種のバナナの祖先種である。"
    },
    "en": {
      "source": "Wikipedia 英語版「Musa balbisiana」",
      "source_url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Musa_balbisiana",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-09",
      "revision": 1377165737,
      "text": "Musa balbisiana, also known simply as plantain, is a wild-type species of banana. It is one of the ancestors of modern cultivated bananas, along with Musa acuminata."
    }
